stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Agent
    Agent --> Pending: queue / lateResult
    Pending --> Agent: dispatch [current ticket and permission]
    Agent --> NewOwner: take
    Pending --> NewOwner: take
    NewOwner --> Agent: returnPage / invalidate ticket
    Agent --> Cancelled: cancel
    Pending --> Cancelled: cancel
    NewOwner --> Cancelled: cancel
    Agent --> Recovering: crash
    Pending --> Recovering: crash
    NewOwner --> Recovering: crash
    Cancelled --> Recovering: crash
    Recovering --> Agent: reconcile [not cancelled, agent owns page]
    Recovering --> NewOwner: reconcile [new task owns page]
    Recovering --> Cancelled: reconcile [cancelled]
    note right of Recovering
      Recovery preserves cancellation and ownership by assumption.
      unsafeRestore deliberately breaks the ownership fence.
      Already dispatched external effects are outside this model.
    end note
